    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374506266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93421,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374512466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Certainly. I can help with that. To pull up your account, could I get your name and order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374514466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Peterson. Order is... VF-886-2149.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93421,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374521133332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. I see your order for the VeloFit Pro-Pedal cycling shoes. To make sure I understand, what specifically is the issue with the shoes? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference matter?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374523933332
    },
    {
      "text": "They just don't work. I keep getting blisters.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93421,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374537733332
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. Blisters are definitely no fun. Have you had a chance to adjust the cleats? Sometimes a small adjustment there can make a big difference in comfort.",
