      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374540999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Obviously. I've tried everything. I just want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93421,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374552666664
    },
    {
      "text": "Understood. Let me just check the delivery date here... Okay, I see they were delivered 58 days ago. According to our policy, you have 90 days to make a return, so you're well within the timeframe.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374556533330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So what's the next step?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93421,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765374569866663
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just approved the return in our system. I'm sending an email to you now with a pre-paid return label. Just pack the cycling shoes in a box, attach the label, and drop them off. Once our warehouse receives them, we'll process your full refund.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
